# Large / regeneratable data artifacts — regenerate via scripts/*.py.
# Kept out of git: raw sample + scrape-attempt log + scraped images (large,
# and scraped text may be copyrighted). validation_results.csv, flags.json,
# frame_judgments.json, and inspection_report.md ARE tracked — they're the
# actual review output.
data/*.jsonl
data/images/*
!data/images/.gitkeep

